        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MH11, Solid Brass Modern Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Modern Wall Hook is made from heavy duty solid brass. It is available in a wide array of finishes and comes packaged with mounting hardware. The Heavy Duty Modern Hook is great for hanging up everything from hats and coats, to bags and towels. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MH11-SPECIFICATIONS.gif?v=1704354640\" width=\"334\" height=\"281\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana MH11 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana MH11 Modern Coat and Hat Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 3-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MH11-specifications.pdf?v=1704262368\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana MH11 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
